      </then>

      <else>
        <report type:"PASSED">
          description : "1.31 CISC-ND-001140"
          info        : "The Cisco switch must be configured to encrypt SNMP messages using a FIPS 140-2 approved algorithm.

GROUP ID: V-220553
RULE ID: SV-220553r961506

Without the strong encryption that is provided by the SNMP Version 3 User-based Security Model (USM), an unauthorized user can gain access to network management information that can be used to create a network outage."
          solution    : "Configure the Cisco switch to encrypt SNMP messages using a FIPS 140-2 approved algorithm as shown in the example below:

